flowchart LR
    CLIENT[Anashim]
    API[Live Speech API]
    subgraph SPEECH[Speech Processing]
        AI[AI Inference Platform]
        PARSE[Output Parser]
    end
    LLM[LLM Summarization]
    subgraph STORE[Data Storage]
        S3[(S3/MinIO)]
        PG[(Postgres)]
    end

    CLIENT -->|Live audio| API
    API -->|Prepared audio stream| AI
    AI -->|Model Output| PARSE
    API <-->|Summarization| LLM
    PARSE -->|Real-time transcript updates| API
    API -->|Streaming transcript| CLIENT

    API -->|Session and transcript records| PG
    API -->|Raw audio archive| S3

    classDef client fill:#f6d6e5,stroke:#6b4a59,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef api fill:#fbd8c0,stroke:#7b5b49,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef ai fill:#d7ecd1,stroke:#4e6e49,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef llm fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b8860b,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef parse fill:#d5eef8,stroke:#4b6f7a,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef data fill:#d7e8fb,stroke:#4a6482,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827

    class CLIENT client
    class API api
    class AI ai
    class LLM llm
    class PARSE parse
    class S3,PG data
